    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1047220/extras/4d98de1e2fd0d84205afb987a5fdee3d.avif?t=1746201438\" /></div><br><i>\u2606\u2605\u2606\u2605 ...something debatably wicked this way comes... \u2605\u2606\u2605\u2606</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1047220/extras/22725778459cff020bacea1f86ee8603.poster.avif?t=1746201438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1047220/extras/22725778459cff020bacea1f86ee8603.webm?t=1746201438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1047220/extras/22725778459cff020bacea1f86ee8603.mp4?t=1746201438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>\u263b 1 hour estimated completion time \u263b</strong><br><br>The famed Frog Detective returns in the most thrilling mystery yet! A town\u2019s welcoming celebration for a mysterious Invisible Wizard has been ripped to shreds by an unknown culprit. The Detective must find out \u201cwhodunnit\u201d! <br><i>The Case of the Invisible Wizard </i>is the second game in the Frog Detective series, following <i>The Haunted Island</i>, which was loved by all.*<br><br><i>*(Except for one user on Steam who called it \u201ca middle finger and a waste of $5\u201d, but we can\u2019t win em all.)</i><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1047220/extras/d1d8e9b9b9a399985bddbf4d7c5df154.avif?t=1746201438\" /></div>",
